AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; So, in the settings, I\'m going to use bitrate high to get the best video quality possible. &gt;&gt; Okay. going to be shooting at 4K 30 frames per second on that Luna Ultra. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; And on this one when we\'re capturing cinematic shots, we\'re going to shoot at'

[02:06] [scene:talk]
