VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'notice that there is motion blur. &gt;&gt; Oh, yeah. &gt;&gt; So motion blur is natural and we want to replicate motion blur in camera. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; So to do that, I\'m going to apply an ND filter. So you can see that magnetically'

